      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, first...\r\nWe need you to locate the Dragon\r\nthat wields dark magick.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様にはまず――\r\n闇の魔法を操るドラゴンの居場所を\r\n突き止めていただきたいのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 775466,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ever since that Dragon appeared\r\nand the monsters began to emerge,\r\nFirefall Mountain has changed drastically.",
        "Jp" : "あのドラゴンが現れ\r\n魔物が湧き出でるようになってから\r\n火垂れ山の中もすっかり変わってしまいました"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 783680,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We've investigated from this location\r\nseveral times... but it is cunning; \r\nit tricks us at every turn, \r\nand we still haven't found its lair.",
        "Jp" : "この野営地から、我々も何度か調査に\r\n赴いているのですが――策に嵌められたりと\r\n未だに居場所は掴めていないのが現状です"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 783681,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, by defeating the foes sent after us,\r\nwe've found traces of dark power.\r\nSer Arisen, you should be able to track them\r\nback to the source... the Black Dragon's lair.",
        "Jp" : "ただ、我々に仕向けられた魔物を倒すことで\r\n＜闇の力の痕跡が残る＞という手がかりは掴んでいます\r\n覚者様であれば、きっと闇の力の発生場所――\r\n闇のドラゴンの居場所まで辿り着けるでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 783682,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Once you find its lair,\r\nplease return to the encampment.\r\nThis foe is clearly formidable.\r\nMake ample preparations before heading out.",
        "Jp" : "居場所を見つけた際には\r\n是非一度野営地にお戻りください\r\nどう見ても、一筋縄ではいかない相手です\r\n最善の準備をしてから討伐に向かうことをお勧めします"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790319,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
